                "message": "Backfill all children of a book at once and show them in its table\n\nC-u on sp-litnotes-meta-backfill-children, or the new\nsp-litnotes-meta-backfill-all-children, makes the notes of every BibTeX\nentry that cross-references the book without picking. Afterwards the\nnote gets a collection-query-table block (book-sections, or\ncollection-articles for a collection) if it has none, and the block is\nrefreshed so the new notes show.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiAsbQDho5VHotsU68a",
